# Pull Request Target

When creating pull requests for this repository:

- **Always** open PRs against the private fork: `mikelaramie/bank-of-anthos`
- **Never** open PRs against the upstream public repo: `GoogleCloudPlatform/bank-of-anthos`
- Use `origin` (`https://github.com/mikelaramie/bank-of-anthos.git`) as the PR repository
- Default base branch on the fork: `master` (unless the user specifies otherwise)

When using `gh pr create`, always pass:

```bash
gh pr create --repo mikelaramie/bank-of-anthos --base master ...
```

Do not use GitHub links or PR targets that point at `GoogleCloudPlatform/bank-of-anthos`.
